いいたします。\n https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PdmCRc9Ac-opDIRcxYtFCuR0CDPI03Px?usp=share_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_8dai/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1435070, "client_id": 1356390, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ddb7f581/uploads/origins/a7635913-78b3-46b8-a582-0c6e964ff2ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a181c6737c73e595c6756cec7583d549", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ddb7f581/uploads/origins/a7635913-78b3-46b8-a582-0c6e964ff2ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a181c6737c73e595c6756cec7583d549, https://si.imgix.net/ddb7f581/uploads/origins/a7635913-78b3-46b8-a582-0c6e964ff2ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32a840dfdf0367630962977fb813c2ba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ddb7f581/uploads/origins/a7635913-78b3-46b8-a582-0c6e964ff2ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82732d8868269304945f9e5ad7970ea4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ddb7f581/uploads/origins/a7635913-78b3-46b8-a582-0c6e964ff2ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=439017f0203481545570aaf619f15416", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ddb7f581/uploads/origins/a7635913-78b3-46b8-a582-0c6e964ff2ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=439017f0203481545570aaf619f15416, https://si.imgix.net/ddb7f581/uploads/origins/a7635913-78b3-46b8-a582-0c6e964ff2ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9bc932f98ed6134de3c8d2606b8c146d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ddb7f581/uploads/origins/a7635913-78b3-46b8-a582-0c6e964ff2ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=02bde3bceee9c99d7dbc1e2709d60c2c 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I am a huge fan of your Nijisanji art, particularly the one you did for Kuzuha here! https://twitter.com/_8dai/status/1518499929139793925?s=20&t=IkI_IdVRD1KZnOv-yndIIQ\n\nI would like to commission you my original characters for personal use. This is their character reference.\nCharacter A: https://toyhou.se/4863005.neil\n- He is a psychopath type of character that likes seeing the suffering of other people. He is a cold and cynical person.\n\nCharacter B: https://toyhou.se/8619262.cain\n- He is a warm-hearted person on the surface, but deep inside he does not actually care for people but only just his perception of them.\n\nThey are best friends from childhood that drifted apart due to life circumstances but they are unable to get over the past that they had together. It is a love/hate relationship where they currently hate each other but miss the past.\n\nThank you for considering my commission. Please feel free to reject it if it is uncomfortable for you.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_8dai/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1435070, "client_id": 652091, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7c890d83/uploads/origins/1b071f00-d60d-477f-afcb-8c9033778da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b17fbb1b5a36abcc43d29778b0389f6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7c890d83/uploads/origins/1b071f00-d60d-477f-afcb-8c9033778da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b17fbb1b5a36abcc43d29778b0389f6, https://si.imgix.net/7c890d83/uploads/origins/1b071f00-d60d-477f-afcb-8c9033778da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee382c7b7b7dcaeb9f612cc8839d01f3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c890d83/uploads/origins/1b071f00-d60d-477f-afcb-8c9033778da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a8ed79b1adc36174b642e434034cd23 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7c890d83/uploads/origins/1b071f00-d60d-477f-afcb-8c9033778da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f3265d8f9c3996ddc1ce17b3555b4c8f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7c890d83/uploads/origins/1b071f00-d60d-477f-afcb-8c9033778da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f3265d8f9c3996ddc1ce17b3555b4c8f, https://si.imgix.net/7c890d83/uploads/origins/1b071f00-d60d-477f-afcb-8c9033778da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2b7e0e7a1d881ec440c9f70028010810 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c890d83/uploads/origins/1b071f00-d60d-477f-afcb-8c9033778da4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c82396c1f1de456a9fb65d3a685aa5a2 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！私が作った2人のオリジナルキャラクターのコミッションをお願いしたいです。\n\n■ 設定\n近代ファンタジーな世界観です。都会に住んでいます。錬金や魔法等が存在します。\n\n■ ハイゼ / 187cm\n[外見参考] https://toyhou.se/16259450.haize/gallery?key=0ndDrODhO3lr2Ej\n・完成が豊か、愛らしい、社交的\n・とても野心的な為、たまに悪役のように見えることがある \n・まだ出版できていない著者\n\n■ リンク / 184cm\n[外見参考] https://toyhou.se/16259452.link/gallery?key=WfkKf8sxQXkuS1G\n・常時イライラしてるけど、顔には出さない\n・人に合わせて性格が変わる\n・裏通りの医者で、昔は軍に属していた\n\n■ 関係性\n・幼馴染で、別れた元恋人のように振る舞う\n・恋愛感情は無いが、遠い違う世界線では付き合っている\n・ハイゼがリンクをイライラさせがち \n\n■ 概要 \n・どんな衣装でも構いません、気軽に衣装をデザインして着せたりしてください！\n・髪が長いか短いかは関係ない\n・モチーフは「物語、画廊、映画館、紺碧の空、臨海自殺」これらを自由に取り入れることができます \n・流血表現等も大丈夫です \n\nもし金額が足りないのであれば、適当な金額でのアピールをお願いします。\n好きなように描いてください！あなたの絵は本当に美しいです！\n\nhttps://sta.sh/28r9za3yw5x", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1057632, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptabl